            "complaintCategoryWhereOccurredID": 12419001,
            "complaintCategoryWhereOccurredDescr": "On an open banking PISP app (Payment Initiation Service Provider)",
            "partVerbatim": "Complaints Undertaken\nThere had been a £10 payment via my debit card today 02.01.2026. I havent used or been able to access my money since 30.12.2025. I want to know how on earth you tbink its acceptable to take £10 out of my account while I have no access to it! This was my beneifts money from DWP. I owe nothing to you, so why has £10 been taken out? I was threatened to be evicted from the bank from saying this was fraud and not sky bet. I was waiting for nearly an hour for my OWN benefits money in the bank. Embarrassing having to beg for my own benefits back. I think this is fraud that £10 has been taken. In all my years of being an adult no bank has ever taken a random £10 out.",
            "partAdditSupportID": 2432001,
            "partAdditSupportDescr": "Yes",
            "partAdditSupportConsentID": 8415001,
            "partAdditSupportConsentDescr": "3rd Party unverified observation",
            "partInvestigationText": "\"05/01/2026\n14:25:27\nStaff only - 646/659/623 added to *halifax* Acc  Acct to be closed, please advise as per the T&C's. We use information from credit & fraud agencies to help make our decision and the application has not been successful. If customer has further questions please call 0345 835 8020 quoting Ref 180070485\n31/12/2025\n04:10:52\n*App Fraud Team*  declined & all facilities withdrawn. Ref 179736026. Branch to remove blocks 646,659,623 for withdrawal of any BGCs, credit balances less than £100 or cash deposits under £2500 and CLOSE ACCOUNT. Please refer FPI, CHQ balances over £100 or cash deposit over £2500 forfurther review on 03458358020, Mon - Fri 8.30-5.30, Sat 9-12*\n\n30/12/2025\nDEB\nSKYBET CD 7312\n10.00\n02/01/2026\nPAY\nDEBITCARD PAYMENT\n-10.00\"",
            "partOutcomeDecisionText": "\"PCA - Fraud - Debit Card - Card Not Present (CNP)\nPCA - Fraud - Debit Card - Gambling\""
          }
        ],
